主要终点:
Percentage of Participants With Grade II-IV Acute GvHD by Day +120

The first day of grade II-IV acute GvHD will be used to calculate the cumulative incidence. The cumulative incidence will be defined as the percentage of participants with grade II-IV acute GvHD. The diagnosis of acute GvHD is based on clinical and pathological evaluation by the principal investigator in collaboration with the treating physician.

Overall Grades of Acute GvHD:

0 = none;

1. = mild;
2. = moderate;
3. = severe;
4. = life threatening

